// ==========================================================
// IMPORTANT VIVA QUESTIONS
// ==========================================================

// What is SCP?
//
// SCP stands for Secure Copy Protocol.
// It is used to securely transfer files between systems.


// What is SSH?
//
// SSH stands for Secure Shell.
// It provides secure remote login access.


// Why chmod 400?
//
// It restricts file permissions for security.


// Why SCP instead of cp?
//
// SCP provides encrypted secure transfer.
// cp only copies locally.


// What is EC2?
//
// EC2 is a virtual machine service provided by AWS.


